 record hosts the test reports of pull request builds downloaded from Jenkins CI servers of the respective projects, for experiment of the paper \"Revisiting Test-Case Prioritization on Long-Running Test Suites\" from the 33rd ACM SIGSOFT International Symposium on Software Testing and Analysis (ISSTA 2024). This record contains test reports of historical builds that have been deleted from the CI servers of these projects. For the artifact of this paper, please go to <a href=\"https://github.com/lrtsuser/LRTS\">https://github.com/lrtsuser/LRTS</a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Each test report file is in JSON format and has been compressed as a zip. Each test report file may contain multiple test-suite runs. There are over 108,000 test-suite runs in this record.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Note that the folder `tvm2023` contains test reports of the project ` tvm` since Jan 2023, where each test report file contains one specific test-suite run for a given environment due to `tvm`'s CI re-organization.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>To unzip files for project `kafka`, please first join the seperated zip files by running `cat kafka.zip.part-* &gt; kafka.zip`, then run `unzip kafka.zip`.</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Cheng, Runxiang", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0001-5058-9405"}, {"name": "Wang, Shuai", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0006-9741-6716"}, {"name": "Jabbarvand, Reyhaneh", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0002-0668-8526"}, {"name": "Marinov, Darko", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0001-5023-3492"}], "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/lrtsuser/LRTS"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "15580512"}}]}}, "title": "Jenkins CI test reports for \"Revisiting Test-Case Prioritization on Long-Running Test Suites\" (ISSTA 2024)", "lin